  "description": "The frozen RP2-v3 feature sets. A core set is chosen for economic mechanism, coverage, stability and point-in-time availability, never for an individual feature's historical p-value. A rich set is emitted, reported and hashed, and is deliberately outside the primary information sets: a hundred-plus dimensions against a few dozen independent sessions is estimation variance, not information.",
  "notes": {
    "b2_5m_multileg_share": "The master plan names b2_5m_multileg_share. The panel emits the share by size and the share by premium separately; the size share is registered, because it is the one that answers how much of the window was structure rather than direction."
